-*Readings* [AI reading, D25]. Lock-in is not returning. The future narrows, and an attractor is the unfolding narrowing its own future. In `Becoming.Capture`, the outcome a rule holds is an absorbing region in the rule. The main law is close to definitional; the mathematics reused is the eventual periodicity of orbits on finite sets. Which regions actual unfoldings enter, and how deep or wide a basin is, are not derived. Record: [attraction-is-not-returning](·). Study: [section 89](·).
