-**When the course branches.** The laws of `Becoming.Recurrence` and `Becoming.Attraction` are stated for determined laws. A process of the spine fixes only which steps are admissible, so its course can branch. Here they are stated for every process, with no premise ([Becoming.Branching](·)). A configuration returns exactly where its own course can have it again at the next step. Every configuration returns exactly where every region the process never leaves keeps every possibility of its own (`returns_iff_fed_ahead`, `returns_iff_keepsWithin`). The three-way equivalence of `Becoming.Recurrence` comes apart under branching. Keeping every possibility does not give returning (`Transit.keeps_not_returns`); a merge need not lose a possibility (`OneWay.merge_keeps`); and merging nothing gives returning along each run within finitely many configurations (`Branching.Lossless.returns`). Every process necessarily draws in exactly what does not return (`necessarilyDrawn_iff_not_returns`). Being possibly drawn in is losing oneself on some course, and a configuration possibly drawn in can return on another course (`possiblyDrawn_iff`, `OneWay.possibly_not_necessarily`). Determinacy is the named case of determinacy up to likeness (`determined_iff_named`). The main theorems of `Becoming.Experiment` and `Becoming.Mechanism` on how configurations relate hold up to likeness. What needs equality is an intervention on one of two alike configurations, an unregistered past and an unregistered description (`Twins.retarget_breaks`, `keepHistory_new_named`, `carries_unregistered`). The rule region of `Becoming.Capture` is absorbing, and perturbing the state alone is drawn back into what the rule holds (`Law.rule_absorbing`, `Captured.state_perturbation_drawn`). The laws along runs hold for every configuration that can keep moving, with no run given. Within finitely many configurations a run is a course into a return, with no decision and no selection. Asked of every process, it is exactly dependent choice (`Becoming.Onward`, below).
