-**Whole and manifold.** The claim of deductive necessity concerns Becoming as a whole. Generativity is a part of it, not a condition every change must meet. Degeneration, ending and mixed change are all within the same unfolding and need not be renamed generation. See [the foundation's scope](·) and [how relations change](·).
