-*Readings* [AI reading, D25]. Any selection decided by what registers (keeping, rewarding, reproducing, training) reaches exactly what the selector registers. The gap closes only through dependence, observation, or another's registration pooled. Where reaching beyond raises what registers, selection favours it. Read for AI training, the reward process is the selector and training reaches only what the reward registers; the AI connects this with the title of Ren's paper “When Capability Outruns Correction”. Record: [selection-through-registration](·). Study: [section 86](·).
