-*Readings* [AI reading, D33; Ren agreed with the reply containing them]. Of Ren's speculation that the full truth can be derived situationally: from within, any given truth can be said at the next step, and not all of it from one situation. The limit is the projection's, holding the whole in one description inside it; it is not something beyond the truth. Record: [registration-within-what-it-registers](·). Study: [section 95](·).
