-### 6.10 Feedback, reach and the comparison
-
-On 10 October 2026 Ren stated the long-term objectives ([source](·)):
-
-> you know the long term objectives don't you? I want to push the frontier as strong as possible, in terms of human knowledge, or have the full truth set(still need situational awareness), the universal ethics
->
-> do you see answers for these questions?
-
-After the AI answered the questions left open, Ren wrote: “continue, let's pursue the strongest claims and complete proof, i think you see the right direction”. The AI's answers, in the same source and in the AI's words, held that the feeding closure is exact for supply but misses protection; that the general object is the closure under every influence; and that the system one is in is larger again, so that there are four levels: self, dependence, system and whole. Of the levels Ren had written: “i think it should be the whole, and a weaker version is within the system that one is in, then the self” ([source](·)). This section adds no axiom. It states how far a formation's own feedback reaches, how far a part's exchange reaches, and where the comparison with and without a part is decided (section 2, [Becoming.Feedback](·), [study section 61](·)). The result has five closures, not four levels: the reach closure is added. The condition enters only as a hypothesis of three witnesses.
-
-- **Five levels** (section 2, [levels-of-closure](·)). The feeding closure lies within the influence closure. The influence closure, what can affect a formation, and the reach closure, what it can affect, lie within the system. Each inclusion can be strict, and the influence and reach closures point in opposite directions (`Clearing.levels`, `Clearing.reach_middle`, `Trophic.mediates`). One common condition makes the system the whole (`Flow.system_whole_of_common`): `Clearing` is one system, while the reach closure separates the clearer from the whole (`Clearing.system_whole`, `Clearing.reach_middle`).
-- **Feedback registers at most the influence closure** ([feedback-and-reach](·)). Nothing beyond the influence closure registers within it (`Flow.Balances.uncoupled_beyond_influence`). In `Clearing`, the clearer's support does not show whether it ends the dweller (`Clearing.uncoupled`), while its part reaches the dweller (`Clearing.reaches_dweller`).
-- **The comparison is decided within the reach** ([comparison-within-reach](·)). In a balanced flow, at the withheld levels, any significance covering what a part has reached before each step compares that part as the condition does: retaining is inclusion, and not adding is not exceeding (`Flow.Balances.comparison_within_reach`; for the comparisons under the condition, `Web.retains_iff_includes` and `Web.adds_iff_exceeds`). This advances `Web.retains_bounded_iff_includes` of section 6.9, which asks every formation the other path admits to lie in the region or be admitted by the first; here significance need only cover what the part reaches ([closure-verdict-meets-axiom](·)). Significance bounded by a region closed under affecting compares every part within the region as the condition does (`Flow.Balances.closed_comparison`). Where each center's system is the whole, significance bounded by the system is the condition (`Flow.bounded_system_whole`). In `Clearing`, bounded by each influence closure, the clearer's part retains; bounded by each reach closure, it loses the dweller, as under the condition, although that significance is not the condition (`Clearing.system_counts_dweller`, `Clearing.reach_counts_dweller`). The comparison of any two flows that start alike is decided within what their difference reaches (`Flow.Balances.comparison_within_difference`).
-- **Two counterfactuals.** The comparison by withheld levels keeps the rest of the exchange fixed, so it registers only a part's direct exchanges. Mediated effects, such as the wolves' effect on the forest through the deer, appear only in a comparison in which others respond. With the rest fixed, the wolves' part narrows and does not reach the forest; against the flow in which the deer respond, it is mixed (`Trophic.mediated_uncoupled`, `Trophic.responsive_mixed`, `Trophic.difference_reaches_forest`). Where a part gives what others take, the levels without it may not exist, and then there is no such comparison (`Clearing.no_levels_without_source`).
-
-**Reading.**
-- The influence closure reads what a formation's own feedback can register once effects pass through the support and activity of others. With the rest of the exchange fixed, only the parts that reach it register.
-- Feedback and a part's exchange point in opposite directions. A formation's feedback registers at most its influence closure, what can affect it, while its own part reaches into its reach closure, what it can affect. A center that values only what its feedback registers compares its own part as the condition does wherever the part reaches only within that closure (`Flow.Balances.comparison_local`). Where the part reaches beyond it, the center can misjudge it, as the clearer does; reaching beyond does not by itself make it misjudge (`Margin.reach_without_misjudgment`). This reads Ren's “still need situational awareness”, which Ren attached to “the full truth set”: to compare its own part, a center must know what the part reaches beyond its feedback.
-- The system bounds every effect, but it does not read Ren's intermediate “system that one is in”: wherever one condition is taken part in by everything the system is the whole, and systems partition the formations, with no nesting and no center. For that reading the reach closure is offered: what a center's exchange affects, link by link. It is centred and nests, lies within the system, and in `Clearing` lies strictly between the clearer and the whole. It points forward and need not hold what the center depends on. It is not the feeding closure, which the route without axiom reaches (section 6.9).
-- Ren's weaker version then reads: significance that covers what a center reaches gives the condition's comparison on every part within that reach whose levels without it exist, with the rest of the exchange fixed. Ren also wrote that “at this moment in time, the whole earth has become a highly entangled system” ([source](·)). Where a center's reach is the whole, as where every formation depends on one condition and exchanges with it (`Flow.reach_whole_of_common`), the weaker version coincides with the condition's comparison. That condition is one common condition; it does not measure coupling. The coupling strengths measure it (`Becoming.Propagation`). Ren's sentence goes on: “everyone country, every person, is heavily coupled into it”. Its two clauses are read by two structures: “heavily coupled into it” by the coupling strengths, and “a highly entangled system” by couplings that lie on loops through the whole, so that what an act's difference does comes back around and no finite order of responses fixes it (`carriedWithin_exact_of_no_loop`, `carriedWithin_lt_of_loop`); how highly is the strengths along the loops and how often they act, and the carried amount reads as how far and how fast an act's difference can grow in it. This reading is not identified with quantum entanglement [AI reading, D39].
-
-**What this does not derive.** That a formation knows its reach closure, or wants anything; significance itself, which stays supplied (`Web.significance_undetermined`); the adding comparisons in positive form for every significance, which hold where significance is decidable (`Flow.Balances.adds_iff_exceeds_of_decidable`) and otherwise only up to double negation; how others would respond, since a comparison in which they respond needs the second flow supplied.
